span></span></span></u><u style=\"text-underline:#000000 single\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">) 16:00</span></span></span></u></em></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">신청 대상자</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">    </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">1) 2026학년도 2학기를 등록한 글로컬캠퍼스 학부 재학생 </span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.933333px;\"><i>   </i></span>2)수업연한을 초과하지 않은 글로컬캠퍼스 학부 휴학생(전체 휴학기간 중 계절학기 수강 횟수 관계없음)</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">신청학점 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">최대 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">6학점 이내 (</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">휴학생은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">3학점 이내)</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">예비수강신청 방법</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">    1)교양 교과목 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">글로컬캠퍼스 수강신청 시스템(</span><a href=\"https://kupis.kku.ac.kr/wsugang\" target=\"_blank\"><u style=\"text-underline:#800080 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">https://kupis.kku.ac.kr/wsugang</span></span></span></u></a><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">)</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><i>   </i>2)전공<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">/</span></span>교직 교과목 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: </span></span>예비수강신청서 양식(첨부)을 작성하여 학과<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">/</span></span>교직 사무실로 이메일 제출</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">예비수강신청 교과목</span><em><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">(</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">/</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">교양</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">/</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">교직 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">)</span></span></em></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">    </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">1)대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">: </span></span><u style=\"text-underline:#000000 single\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">2026학년도 교육과정 상 편성된 수업 중</span></span></u> <span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">‘</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">실험</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">+</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">실습</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">+</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">실기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">’</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.4pt\">를 제외한 모든 교과목</span></span><em><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.1pt\">(e-</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.1pt\">러닝도 계절학기 개설 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.1pt\">)</span></span></span></em><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><i>   </i>2)본수강신청 과목 선정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">10명 이상</span></span> <span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">예비수강신청 인원 충족 시</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.7pt\">※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">,  </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">10명 이상 충족되더라도 교양영역별(1~2</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">과목)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\"> /  </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">전공별 강좌수 균형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">, </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.9pt\">강사 배정</span> <span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.8pt\">등 상황에</span> <span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.7pt\">따라 개설 불가할 수 있음</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"> </span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">2. 계절학기 교과목 개설 원칙</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\">  가<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span>예비수강신청 10명 이상 <span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">→ </span>본수강신청 대상 교과목으로 선정</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\">  나<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span>본수강신청 10명 이상 <span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">→ </span>개설예정 교과목으로 선정</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\">  다<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span>개설 교과목에 <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">10명 이상 </span><u style=\"text-underline:#000000 single\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">최종 등록이 되어야 개설</span></u></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"> </span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">3. 기타사항</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">그 외 계절학기에 대한 공지 및 전체 일정은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">‘</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">계절학기 계획</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">’ </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">공지 참조</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">실시간 양방향 온라인 강의</span>로 진행을 원칙으로 함</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">서울캠퍼스 계절학기 수강희망자는 별도의 예비수강신청이 필요 없으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">, </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">본수강신청 기간에 서울캠퍼스로 수강신청 해야 함</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">예비수강신청은 개설교과목을 선정하기 위함이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">, </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">계절학기에 참가하고자 하는 학생은 예비수강신청 참가여부와 관계 없이 </span><u style=\"text-underline:#000000 single\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000\">반드시 본수강신청을 해야함</span></span></span></u><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">(예비수강신청을 하지 않은 학생도 본수강신청 가능)</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">  마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">. </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">계절학기는 캠퍼스별</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">(글로컬</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">/</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">서울)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">운영하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">, </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">양 캠퍼스 중 </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">1개의 캠퍼스에서만 수강 가능</span>함</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">    ※서울캠퍼스 계절학기 수강자는 서울캠퍼스 일정과 계획을 준수해야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">, </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">이수 과목은 '</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">일반선택</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">(일선)'</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">으로만 인정됨</span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"> </span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">4. 문의 </span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\">  가<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span>글로컬캠퍼스 학사지원팀 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: 043-840-3253</span></span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\">  나<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">. </span></span>서울캠퍼스 학사팀 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: 02-450-3192</span></span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"> </span></span><br>\r\n<span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">첨 부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">계절학기 교과목 개설 신청서</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">(양식)<i> </i></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">1부 </span></span></span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n \r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\">2026. 10.</span><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"> </span></span></span></span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"word-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.7pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">교 무 처 장</span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n","LINK_URL_YN":"N","LINK_URL":null,"WRITER_NM":"학사지원팀","REG_USER_ID":"22110227","DEPT_CD":null,"DEPT_NM":null,"PASSWD":null,"EMAIL":null,"USE_COMMENT_YN":"N","USE_REPLY_YN":"N","CATE_SEQ":null,"CATE_LVL":null,"P_CATE_SEQ":null,"SECRET_YN":"N","EDITOR_YN":"Y","OPEN_YN":"Y","OPEN_NM":"노출","START_DT":null,"END_DT":null,"STATUS":null,"STATUS_NM":"-","ORD_NO":2123,"HITS":352,"RECOMMS":0,"WRITE_DATE":"2026.10.14","WRITE_DT":"2026-10-14 14:44:00.0","NEW_YN":"N","FROM_DATE":"-","TO_DATE":"-","GONGO_GUBUN":"ING","NOTICE_YN":"Y","TOP_NOTICE_YN":"N","CATEGORY_NM1":null,"CATEGORY_NM1_COLOR":null,"CATEGORY_NM2":null,"CATEGORY_NM2_COLOR":null,"CATEGORY_NM":null,"CATE_COLOR":null,"COMMENT_CNT":0,"REPLY_CNT":0,"FILE_CNT":1,"FILE_ORG_NM":"예비수강신청서양식(학생용).hwp","FILE_TO_CNT":0},{"RNUM_DESC":1,"RNUM":2,"BOARD_SEQ":18,"SITE_NO":2,"BOARD_TYPE":"C0301","BBS_SEQ":120218,"P_BBS_SEQ":null,"SUBJECT":"2026학년도 동계 계절학기 운영 계획 안내","SUBJECT_COLOR":null,"SUB_CONTENTS":"  \r\n ※문의처: 교무처 학사지원팀(043-840-3253) ","CONTENTS":"<img alt=\".\" src=\"/directFile/attach/smartEditor/202610/d2889c09-66fd-4d9a-be22-3220b7d20c0b.png